      },
      "body": "Extend the profiler scopes in `RDNAHybridW4A16LinearKernel` to report group size and symmetric vs asymmetric on top of `MxNxK` shapes to help reading the profile.\r\n\r\nLabels become, for example:\r\n```\r\nwvsplitk_int4 1x256x1024 g=32 asym\r\nhybrid_triton_w4a16 64x256x1024 g=128 sym\r\n```\r\nTesting: verified under torch.profiler on gfx1151 that all four combinations (decode/prefill x sym/asym) emit the intended label; pytest tests/kernels/quantization/test_rdna_hybrid_w4a16.py passes unchanged.\r\n",
      "changedFiles": 1,
